Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}IN THIS WORLD,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.09,0:00:02.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}TOYS PLAY THEMSELVES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:03.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}YOU DON'T PLAY WITH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.93,0:00:04.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}A TOY KITCHEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}IT COOKS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}BABY DOLLS CHANGE THEIR
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:07.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}OWN DIAPERS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.97,0:00:08.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}TOY CARS DRIVE TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}WORK,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.31,0:00:10.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SIT IN TRAFFIC,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND HONK AT EACH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:11.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}OTHER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND KIDS?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:13.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}KIDS JUST SIT ON
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:14.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THE CARPET AND WATCH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:15.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THE FANCIER THE TOY,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:16.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THE LESS YOU HAVE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:17.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}TO DO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}RICH KIDS DON'T EVEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:18.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}WATCH.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:20.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEIR TOYS WATCH THEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:21.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}FOR MY BIRTHDAY,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:22.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}EVERYONE GOT ME SOMETHING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:23.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AMAZING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:24.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}A TOY OFFICE THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}DOES ITS OWN TAXES.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:27.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}A TOY SOLDIER THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}ALREADY KNEW HOW TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:28.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SALUTE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEN GRANDPA GAVE ME
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:30.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}A BOX.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:32.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}INSIDE WERE BLOCKS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:32.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}PLAIN,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}WOODEN BLOCKS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:34.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEY DIDN'T BEEP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:35.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEY DIDN'T MOVE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:36.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEY DIDN'T DO ANYTHING.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}"THEY'RE BROKEN,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:38.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}I SAID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}GRANDPA SMILED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:40.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}"NO,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:40.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}KIDDO.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:41.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEY'RE WAITING."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:43.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}I HID THEM UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:43.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY BED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:44.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}WAITING FOR WHAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:45.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THAT NIGHT,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY KITCHEN MADE SOUP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY OFFICE WORKED LATE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:49.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY SOLDIER MARCHED OFF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:50.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}TO A WAR HE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:51.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}NEVER PICKED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:52.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND I WAS BORED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.73,0:00:53.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SO,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:53.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SO BORED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:54.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SO I TOOK OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}ONE BLOCK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:56.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEN ANOTHER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.56,0:00:57.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}I BUILT A WALL.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:58.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEN A TOWER.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.35,0:00:59.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THEN A TOWER WITH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:00:59.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}A DOOR,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:00.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND A DRAGON ON
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:01.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}TOP,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:02.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND A MOAT FULL
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:03.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}OF SHARKS WEARING HATS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:05.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}NOBODY HAD EVER MADE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:06.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THAT BEFORE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:07.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}NOT THE FACTORY.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}NOT THE COMMERCIALS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:08.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:10.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}THE NEXT MORNING,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY KITCHEN WAS STILL
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:12.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MAKING THE SAME SOUP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:13.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND MY BLOCKS?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}MY BLOCKS WERE A
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:15.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SPACESHIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.71,0:01:16.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SO NOW I KNOW.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:17.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}SOME TOYS PLAY FOR
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:17.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:19.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND SOME TOYS WAIT,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:19.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}FOR YOU TO SHOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:20.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fscx92\fscy92\t(0,80,\fscx100\fscy100)}UP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.03,0:01:25.53,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)}A toy that does everything\Nmakes you a user.\N\NA toy that does nothing\Nmakes you a creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:25.53,Credit,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)}after Roland Barthes, "Toys", Mythologies (1957)
